<body>
<div class="bg"></div>
<div class="blind" id="blind" onclick="openBlind()"><div class="mbox" id="mbox">🎁</div><div class="mhint">点击开启盲盒</div></div>
<header><div class="c"><div class="logo"><div class="logo-icon">🐼</div><div class="logo-text">PandaToken</div></div><nav><a href="#home">首页</a><a href="#features">特性</a><a href="#staking">质押</a><a href="#exchange">兑换</a><a href="#dice">🎲</a></nav><div class="actions"><span class="net">● TRON</span><div class="w-info" id="wInfo"><span class="addr" id="wAddr"></span><span class="bal" id="wBal">0</span></div><button class="btn btn-primary" id="cBtn" onclick="connectWallet()">连接钱包</button><button class="btn btn-outline" id="dBtn" onclick="disconnectWallet()" style="display:none">断开</button></div></div></header>
<section class="hero" id="home"><div class="badge">🚀 下一代价值代币</div><h1>PandaToken (PANDA)</h1><p class="subtitle">只涨不跌加密货币，为熊猫闪充生态赋能</p><a href="shop.html" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding:12px 32px;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;">购买电子烟</a><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><div class="v">40亿</div><div class="l">代币总量</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="v">$0.005</div><div class="l">初始价格</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="v">3,000</div><div class="l">每支代币</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="v" id="pDis">$0.0052</div><div class="l">当前价</div></div></div></section>
<section class="sec" id="features"><h2>核心特性</h2><p>独特的经济模型，确保只涨不跌</p><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="icon">📈</div><h3>只涨不跌</h3><p>独特经济模型</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon">🎁</div><h3>盲盒惊喜</h3><p>密钥开启盲盒</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon">🎲</div><h3>骰子游戏</h3><p>趣味博彩</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon">🔒</div><h3>质押收益</h3><p>15%-90%年化</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon">⚡</div><h3>Turbo释放</h3><p>稳定币价</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon">🔄</div><h3>Swap交易</h3><p>代币变现</p></div></div></section>
<section class="sec" id="staking"><h2>质押收益</h2><p>锁定代币，获得丰厚收益</p><div class="stakes"><div class="stake"><div class="period">30天</div><div class="apy">15%<span>/年</span></div><ul><li>每日计算收益</li><li>到期自动解锁</li></ul><button onclick="showStake(30)">质押</button></div><div class="stake featured"><div class="period">60天</div><div class="apy">45%<span>/年</span></div><ul><li>更高收益</li><li>每日释放</li></ul><button onclick="showStake(60)">质押</button></div><div class="stake"><div class="period">90天</div><div class="apy">90%<span>/年</span></div><ul><li>最高收益</li><li>机构首选</li></ul><button onclick="showStake(90)">质押</button></div></div><div class="ex-card st-form" id="stForm"><h3 style="margin-bottom:18px" id="stTitle">质押 - 30天</h3><div class="bal-disp"><span class="l">钱包余额</span><span class="v" id="stBal">0 PANDA</span></div><div class="daily"><div class="l">预计每日收益</div><div class="v" id="dailyE">0 PANDA/天</div></div><div class="inp-grp"><input type="number" id="stAmt" placeholder="输入质押数量" oninput="calcStake()"><button onclick="setMaxStake()">全部</button></div><div class="info"><div class="row"><span>质押数量</span><span class="v" id="stConfAmt">0</span></div><div class="row"><span>期限</span><span class="v" id="stConfDays">30天</span></div><div class="row"><span>预计收益</span><span class="v" id="stConfRew">0 PANDA</span></div></div><button class="btn-full" onclick="confirmStake()">确认质押</button></div></section>
<section class="sec" id="exchange"><h2>兑换中心</h2><p>多种方式管理您的代币</p><div class="ex-card"><div class="tabs"><button class="tab active" onclick="switchTab('key')">密钥兑换</button><button class="tab" onclick="switchTab('turbo')">Turbo</button><button class="tab" onclick="switchTab('swap')">Swap</button></div>
<div class="panels active" id="keyP"><div class="g"><label>🎁 输入密钥</label><input type="text" id="keyIn" placeholder="请输入密钥" style="width:100%;padding:14px;background:var(--dark);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border-radius:10px;color:var(--text)"></div><div class="tip">每个密钥可开启盲盒，代币随机(最高3000)</div><button class="btn-full" onclick="redeemKey()">🎁 开启盲盒</button></div>
<div class="panels" id="turboP"><div class="g"><label>⚡ 释放方式</label></div><div class="topt"><div class="opt" onclick="selectTurbo(this,'direct')"><div class="n">🚀 直接</div><div class="f">-20%</div><div class="t">即时USDT</div></div><div class="opt selected" onclick="selectTurbo(this,'30d')"><div class="n">📅 30天</div><div class="f">-10%</div><div class="t">每天释放</div></div><div class="opt" onclick="selectTurbo(this,'60d')"><div class="n">📆 60天</div><div class="f">0%</div><div class="t">每天释放</div></div></div><div class="g" style="margin-top:18px"><label>🔄 数量</label><div class="inp-wrap"><input type="number" id="tAmt" placeholder="输入数量" oninput="calcTurbo()"><button class="max" onclick="setMaxTurbo()">全部</button></div><div class="tip" id="tBal">可用: 0 PANDA</div></div><div class="info"><div class="row"><span>释放</span><span class="v" id="tOut">0</span></div><div class="row"><span>手续费</span><span class="v" id="tFee">0</span></div><div class="row"><span>USDT</span><span class="v" id="tUSD">$0</span></div></div><div class="note">⚠️ 线性释放需到期后方可Swap</div><button class="btn-full" onclick="executeTurbo()">⚡ 执行Turbo</button></div>
<div class="panels" id="swapP"><div class="g"><label>🔄 Swap数量</label><div class="inp-wrap"><input type="number" id="sAmt" placeholder="输入数量" oninput="calcSwap()"><button class="max" onclick="setMaxSwap()">全部</button></div><div class="tip" id="sBal">可Swap: 0 (需Turbo释放)</div></div><div class="info"><div class="row"><span>汇率</span><span class="v">1=$0.005</span></div><div class="row"><span>获得</span><span class="v" id="sOut">$0</span></div><div class="row"><span>费5%</span><span class="v" id="sFee">$0</body></html>
